      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme Yehoshafati wa Yuda alirejea salama katika ikulu yake mjini Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini mwonaji Yehu mwana wa Hanani, alikwenda kumlaki mfalme, akamwambia, “Je, unadhani ni vema kuwasaidia waovu na kuwapenda wamchukiao Mwenyezi-Mungu? Mambo uliyofanya yamekuletea ghadhabu ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walakini, kuna wema fulani ndani yako. Umekwisha ziondoa sanamu zote za Ashera, mungu wa kike, na umejitahidi sana kumtafuta Mungu kwa moyo wote.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme Yehoshafati alikaa Yerusalemu, lakini hata hivyo, mara kwa mara aliwatembelea watu wa Beer-sheba kusini, mpaka milima ya Efraimu, upande wa kaskazini. Alifanya hivyo ili kuwavutia watu wamrudie Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa babu zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliteua waamuzi katika miji yote ya Yuda yenye ngome, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akawaambia, “Muwe waangalifu sana wakati mnapoamua, kwa maana hukumu mtoayo hamwitoi kwa amri ya binadamu, bali kwa amri itokayo kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, naye yu pamoja nanyi mnapotoa uamuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, sasa mwogopeni Mwenyezi-Mungu, muwe waangalifu katika kila jambo mtakalotenda kwa sababu Mwenyezi-Mungu wetu hatavumilia upotoshaji wa haki, wala upendeleo wala ulaji rushwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mjini Yerusalemu, Yehoshafati aliteua Walawi kadhaa, waamuzi na baadhi ya wakuu wa jamaa za Waisraeli wawe waamuzi wa magomvi yahusuyo uvunjaji wa sheria za Mwenyezi-Mungu, au ugomvi baina ya wakazi wa mji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akawaamuru akisema; “Tekelezeni wajibu wenu mkimwogopa Mwenyezi-Mungu, kwa uaminifu na kwa moyo wote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kila mara ndugu zenu kutoka katika mji wowote ule wanapowaletea shtaka lolote kuhusu uuaji, uvunjaji wa sheria, amri, kanuni au maagizo, washaurini vema ili wasije wakamkosea Mwenyezi-Mungu. Msipofanya hivyo, nyinyi pamoja na ndugu zenu mtapatwa na ghadhabu ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. Lakini mkiutekeleza wajibu wenu, hamtakuwa na hatia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaria, kuhani mkuu, ndiye atakayesimamia mambo yote yanayomhusu Mwenyezi-Mungu, naye Zebadia mwana wa Ishmaeli, gavana wa Yuda atasimamia mambo yote ya utawala, na Walawi watakuwa maofisa. Jipeni moyo muyatekeleze masharti haya, naye Mwenyezi-Mungu awe pamoja nao walio wema.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
